{"id":"engagement","lemma":"engagement","pos":"noun","rank":2602,"glosses":["commitment","engagement"],"ipa":"/ɑ̃.ɡaʒ.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-engagement.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-engagement.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"engagements"},"formAudio":{"engagements":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-engagements.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est un engagement énorme.","en":"It's a huge commitment.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"enormous, huge"}]},{"text":"C'est un engagement pour la vie.","en":"It's a lifetime commitment.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"for life"]]},{"text":"Malheureusement, j'avais un autre engagement.","en":"Unfortunately, I had another commitment.","words":[{"g":"unfortunately"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"another, a different"]]},{"text":"Je suis désolé, j'ai un autre engagement.","en":"I'm sorry, I have another commitment.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"sorry"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"another, a different"]]},{"text":"C'est sans engagement de votre part.","en":"There are no strings attached.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"share"}]}]}